 "name_en": "Quality Management in Sales (1MP)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Quality Management in Sales (1MP)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item manages quality inspection activities in outbound delivery processes. Quality inspection activities may be important before goods issue.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">When creating an outbound delivery for a material that is the subject of an inspection in the sales and delivery process, an inspection lot is created based on an inspection plan. The quality technician records the inspection results for a sample size. Based on these inspection results, the quality engineer makes a usage decision, for example, accepting or rejecting the material. If accepted, the goods are posted and sent to the customer. If rejected, the whole quantity is posted to blocked stock and the delivery is updated. For the rejected results, a defect is automatically recorded. Any further stock of the same material must be accepted before they are delivered.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Sell material to a customer and create an outbound delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review inspection plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display open inspection lots</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Record quality inspection results</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make usage decision, optionally attach documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review and analyze defects</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issue for the outbound delivery</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate quality inspection activities in the sales process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use inspection plans for quality inspections</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Detect nonconformities before delivering materials to a customer</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>销售中的质量管理 (1MP)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目管理出库交货流程中的质量检验活动。在发货之前，质量检验活动可能很重要。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">为作为销售和交货流程中检验主题的物料创建出库交货时，将根据检验计划创建检验批。质量技术员记录样本大小的检验结果。根据这些检验结果，质量工程师制定使用决策，例如，接受或拒绝物料。如果接受，货物将过账并发送给客户。如果拒绝，则整个数量将过账到冻结库存并更新交货。对于拒绝的结果，将自动记录缺陷。在交付之前，必须接受同一物料的任何其他库存。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">向客户销售物料，并创建出库交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查检验计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示未清检验批</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">记录质量检验结果</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">制定使用决策，可以选择附加文档</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看和分析缺陷</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账出库交货的发货</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0ad4fe0e6850464f89ba38bcd62e0268__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将质量检验活动集成到销售流程中</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用检验计划进行质量检验</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">向客户交付物料之前检测不合格</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
